{"name":"Nightlife","hex":"#27426b","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"nightlife","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Nocturnal activities, especially visiting nightclubs."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/nightlife"}],"entries":[{"title":"Nightlife","blocks":[{"text":"Nightlife is a collective term for entertainment that is available and generally more popular from the late evening into the early hours of the morning. It includes pubs, bars, nightclubs, parties, live music, concerts, cabarets, theatre, cinemas, and shows. These venues often require a cover charge for admission. Nightlife entertainment is often more adult-oriented than daytime entertainment. People who prefer to be active during the night-time are called night owls."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/1_times_square_night_2013.jpg/330px-1_times_square_night_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nightlife","wikidata":"Q1594437"},{"title":"Nightlife (Pet Shop Boys album)","blocks":[{"text":"Nightlife is the seventh studio album by English synth-pop duo Pet Shop Boys, released on 8 October 1999 by EMI in Germany and Japan and on 11 October 1999 by Parlophone in the UK. After the release and promotion of their previous album, Bilingual (1996), Pet Shop Boys started work with playwright Jonathan Harvey on the stage musical that eventually became Closer to Heaven; at one stage during the writing process, the musical was given the name Nightlife. Pet Shop Boys soon had an album's worth of tracks and decided to release the album Nightlife as a concept album and in order to showcase some of the songs that would eventually make it into the musical."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/56/Pet_Shop_Boys_-_Nightlife.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nightlife_(Pet_Shop_Boys_album)","wikidata":"Q1049789"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Cairo%27s_night_09.jpg/500px-Cairo%27s_night_09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Cairo%27s_night_09.jpg/1280px-Cairo%27s_night_09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Cairo%27s_night_09.jpg/500px-Cairo%27s_night_09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Cairo, Egypt, emerged as the most dynamic city of Africa for 2026.[2][3]","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACairo's_night_09.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Anhangaba%C3%BA_de_noite.jpg/500px-Anhangaba%C3%BA_de_noite.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Anhangaba%C3%BA_de_noite.jpg/1280px-Anhangaba%C3%BA_de_noite.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Anhangaba%C3%BA_de_noite.jpg/500px-Anhangaba%C3%BA_de_noite.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"São Paulo, Brazil, has the best nightlife in the world, according to the World's Best Cities 2026.[4]","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAnhangaba%C3%BA_de_noite.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Night_of_the_Ancient_Bonfires_Estonia.jpg/500px-Night_of_the_Ancient_Bonfires_Estonia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Night_of_the_Ancient_Bonfires_Estonia.jpg/1280px-Night_of_the_Ancient_Bonfires_Estonia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_conte